# The build context is the repository root, and most of it has no business in an image.
.git/
.github/
docs/
legacy/
testdata/
coverage-report/

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/data/
**/logs/
**/*.user

# A container is configured by environment variable, so nothing environment-specific belongs in
# the image. Keeping these out of the context means `dotnet publish` cannot pick them up either.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.env
